/* 客户详情页（对照设计稿 03 客户详情 / 04 状态流转确认，px→rpx ×2） */
/* 底部动作面板样式拆分至同目录 panel.wxss（控制单文件行数） */
@import "panel.wxss";

.page {
  min-height: 100vh;
  background: var(--fog);
}

/* ===== 加载态 / 空态 ===== */
.state-box {
  padding: 200rpx 40rpx;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
}
.state-text {
  font-size: 28rpx;
  color: var(--graphite);
}
.empty {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 180rpx 80rpx 0;
}
.empty-orb {
  width: 140rpx;
  height: 140rpx;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--apricot-wash);
  color: var(--rust);
  font-size: 60rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  margin-bottom: 32rpx;
}
.empty-title {
  font-size: 32rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--ink);
}
.empty-sub {
  margin-top: 14rpx;
  font-size: 25rpx;
  color: var(--graphite);
  line-height: 1.8;
}
.empty-cta {
  margin-top: 44rpx;
  height: 80rpx;
  padding: 0 52rpx;
  border-radius: 9999rpx;
  background: var(--ink);
  color: #ffffff;
  font-size: 27rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  line-height: 1;
}
.empty-cta::after {
  border: none;
}

/* ===== 统一状态标签（设计稿 stg-*，页面与面板共用） ===== */
.stg {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  font-size: 21rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  padding: 6rpx 20rpx;
  border-radius: 9999rpx;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.stg-new {
  background: var(--sky-wash);
  color: #1d5bb8;
}
.stg-contact {
  background: var(--apricot-wash);
  color: var(--rust);
}
.stg-high {
  background: var(--rust);
  color: var(--apricot-wash);
}
.stg-won {
  background: var(--mint);
  color: #0b7a5c;
}
.stg-out {
  background: #f2f3f5;
  color: var(--slate);
}

/* ===== 1. 状态 hero 卡 ===== */
.hero-card {
  margin: 16rpx 32rpx 0;
  background: #ffffff;
  border-radius: 32rpx;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  padding: 32rpx;
}
.hero-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 20rpx;
}
.lc-time {
  font-size: 21rpx;
  color: var(--dove);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}
.hero-title {
  margin-top: 20rpx;
  font-size: 34rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1.4;
}
.hero-sub {
  margin-top: 10rpx;
  font-size: 25rpx;
  color: var(--graphite);
  line-height: 1.7;
}

/* ===== 2. 手机号深色卡 ===== */
.phone-card {
  margin: 20rpx 32rpx 0;
  background: var(--ink);
  border-radius: 32rpx;
  padding: 32rpx;
  color: #ffffff;
}
.pc-label {
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
}
.pc-row {
  margin-top: 16rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 24rpx;
}
.pc-num {
  font-size: 46rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 1rpx;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.pc-btn {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  margin: 0;
  height: 68rpx;
  padding: 0 30rpx;
  border-radius: 9999rpx;
  background: #ffffff;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-size: 25rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  line-height: 1;
}
.pc-btn::after {
  border: none;
}
.pc-note {
  margin-top: 20rpx;
  font-size: 21rpx;
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
  line-height: 1.6;
  border-top: 1rpx solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  padding-top: 18rpx;
}

/* ===== 信息卡通用 ===== */
.info-card {
  margin: 20rpx 32rpx 0;
  background: #ffffff;
  border-radius: 32rpx;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  padding: 30rpx 32rpx;
}
.ic-head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
}
.ic-title {
  font-size: 27rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--ink);
}
.ic-link {
  font-size: 23rpx;
  color: var(--graphite);
}

/* ===== 3. 业务信息栅格（2 列） ===== */
.info-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 24rpx 32rpx;
  margin-top: 26rpx;
}
.ig-item .k {
  font-size: 21rpx;
  color: var(--dove);
}
.ig-item .v {
  margin-top: 6rpx;
  font-size: 27rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--ink);
  word-break: break-all;
}
.ig-item .v.num {
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}
.ig-item .v.mut {
  color: var(--dove);
  font-weight: 400;
}

/* ===== 4. 时间线（归因链路 / 跟进记录共用） ===== */
.tl {
  margin-top: 28rpx;
}
.tl-item {
  display: flex;
  gap: 24rpx;
  position: relative;
  padding-bottom: 32rpx;
}
.tl-item:last-child {
  padding-bottom: 4rpx;
}
.tl-item::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  left: 10rpx;
  top: 28rpx;
  bottom: 0;
  width: 2rpx;
  background: #f2f3f5;
}
.tl-item:last-child::before {
  display: none;
}
.tl-dot {
  width: 22rpx;
  height: 22rpx;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--sky-wash);
  border: 5rpx solid #1d5bb8;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  margin-top: 4rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  z-index: 1;
}
.tl-dot.dim {
  background: var(--fog);
  border-color: var(--dove);
}
.tl-main {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
}
.tl-text {
  font-size: 26rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1.5;
  word-break: break-all;
}
.tl-time {
  margin-top: 4rpx;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: var(--dove);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}

/* ===== 5. 状态流转卡 ===== */
.flow-bar {
  margin-top: 28rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
}
.fb-node {
  flex: 1;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10rpx;
  position: relative;
}
.fb-dot {
  width: 44rpx;
  height: 44rpx;
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 21rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  background: var(--fog);
  color: var(--slate);
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2rpx #ececee;
  z-index: 1;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.fb-node.done .fb-dot {
  background: var(--apricot-wash);
  color: var(--rust);
  box-shadow: none;
}
.fb-node.cur .fb-dot {
  background: var(--rust);
  color: #ffffff;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 8rpx rgba(93, 42, 26, 0.14);
}
.fb-lab {
  font-size: 19rpx;
  color: var(--graphite);
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.fb-node.cur .fb-lab {
  color: var(--rust);
  font-weight: 600;
}
.fb-node::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: 22rpx;
  left: calc(-50% + 24rpx);
  right: calc(50% + 24rpx);
  height: 3rpx;
  background: #f2f3f5;
}
.fb-node:first-child::before {
  display: none;
}
.fb-node.done::before {
  background: var(--rust);
  opacity: 0.35;
}
/* 淘汰旁路说明行 */
.fb-out-row {
  margin-top: 24rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12rpx;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: var(--slate);
  line-height: 1.5;
}
.fb-dot-x {
  width: 32rpx;
  height: 32rpx;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #f2f3f5;
  color: var(--slate);
  font-size: 18rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.fb-note {
  margin-top: 24rpx;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: var(--slate);
  line-height: 1.6;
}
.fb-actions {
  margin-top: 28rpx;
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 16rpx;
}
.btn-sm {
  margin: 0;
  height: 60rpx;
  padding: 0 28rpx;
  border-radius: 9999rpx;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  line-height: 1;
}
.btn-sm::after {
  border: none;
}
.btn-ink {
  background: var(--ink);
  color: #ffffff;
}
.btn-warm {
  background: var(--apricot-wash);
  color: var(--rust);
}
.btn-ghost {
  background: #ffffff;
  color: var(--ash);
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2rpx #ececee;
}

/* ===== 6. 跟进记录 ===== */
.fu-input-row {
  margin-top: 24rpx;
  display: flex;
  gap: 16rpx;
}
.fu-input {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  height: 76rpx;
  border-radius: 24rpx;
  border: 2rpx solid #ececee;
  background: var(--fog);
  padding: 0 26rpx;
  font-size: 25rpx;
  color: var(--ink);
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.fu-add {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  margin: 0;
  height: 76rpx;
  padding: 0 32rpx;
  border-radius: 24rpx;
  background: var(--ink);
  color: #ffffff;
  font-size: 25rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  line-height: 1;
}
.fu-add::after {
  border: none;
}
.fu-add[disabled] {
  opacity: 0.6;
  background: var(--ink);
  color: #ffffff;
}
.fu-empty {
  margin-top: 28rpx;
  padding: 36rpx 0;
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: var(--dove);
}

/* ===== 底部安全区 ===== */
.safe-bottom {
  height: 40rpx;
}
